message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AetherGovern v2.0.0: Reference Implementation of the Falsification-First Governance Architecture"
version: 2.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24054524
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: MIT
license-url: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/gitdeeper15/aethergovern
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24054524
abstract: >
  AetherGovern v2.0.0 is the reference implementation of the AetherGovern
  falsification-first governance architecture specified in v0.1.0. It
  implements ten entities, seven operations, and 47 invariants, with a
  test suite of 60 tests and three reproducible experiments. The v0.1.0
  hypothesis (F1-F5) is not falsified by the implementation or the
  experiments, but is also not confirmed. The final project structure
  (single, dual, or triple project) remains undetermined. No real-world
  deployment has been evaluated.
